---
// src/pages/journey.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
    title="My Journey — Javier Flores | A Story of Travel and Life"
    description="More than just a list of places I've been. This is my story of growing up, working hard, and learning from the world."
    lang="en"
    pathEs="viajes"
    pathEn="journey"
>
    <div class="journey-container">
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="journey-hero">
            <div class="hero-inner">
                <span class="hero-badge">My Story</span>
                <h1 class="hero-title">Around the World</h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">
                    A small reflection on how it all began and how I’ve been incredibly fortunate to explore the globe, experiencing new cultures, and learning what it truly means to be far away from home and family..
                </p>
                <div class="hero-stats">
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <span class="stat-number">40+</span>
                        <span class="stat-label">Countries & Regions</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <span class="stat-number">180+</span>
                        <span class="stat-label">Cities Explored</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <span class="stat-number">50+</span>
                        <span class="stat-label">Trips & Routes</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <span class="stat-number">2000+</span>
                        <span class="stat-label">Days on the Road</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Main Content & Timeline -->
        <div id="main">
            <section class="wrapper style1">
                <div class="inner">
                    <header class="major">
                        <h2>The Steps I Took</h2>
                        <p>Every place taught me something new, from quiet towns to big stages on the ocean.</p>
                    </header>

                    <div class="timeline-container">

                        <!-- Phase 1: 2018 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">2018</span>
                                <h3>My First Big Jump: Asia</h3>
                                <p>
                                    When I was in my early twenties, I took a huge leap to the other side of the world. I went to <strong>Taiwan</strong> and <strong>South Korea</strong> to play music at festivals. I was nervous, but it showed me that music is a language everyone speaks, no matter where they are from.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Taipei-Taiwan.webp`} alt="Javier Flores in Taiwan" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Yilan-Taiwan.webp`} alt="Javier Flores at the Yilan International Festival" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 2: Late 2018 - Early 2019 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">Late 2018 - Early 2019</span>
                                <h3>Backpacking Through Europe</h3>
                                <p>
                                    I went to school in the <strong>Czech Republic</strong>, which let me travel around Europe on a very small budget. I took trains and walked through <strong>Slovakia</strong>, <strong>Hungary</strong>, <strong>Poland</strong>, <strong>Germany</strong>, <strong>France</strong>, <strong>Belgium</strong>, and the <strong>Netherlands</strong>. I learned how to be on my own and how to really look at the beautiful buildings around me.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Casa-de-la-Musica-de-Viena.webp`} alt="Javier Flores during his time in Europe" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 3: 2019 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">2019</span>
                                <h3>Seeing History in the Middle East</h3>
                                <p>
                                    Next, my work took me to the <strong>United Arab Emirates</strong>. Walking between the very old, quiet streets of Sharjah and the huge, shiny buildings of Dubai changed how I see the world. It showed me how different and amazing people's lives can be.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 4: 2022 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">2022</span>
                                <h3>Beautiful Coasts and Islands</h3>
                                <p>
                                    After a break, I went back to working and traveling. I visited old ports and towns in <strong>Greece</strong>, <strong>France</strong>, <strong>Norway</strong>, <strong>Ireland</strong>, <strong>Croatia</strong>, and <strong>Monaco</strong>. I also got to see beautiful islands like <strong>Jamaica</strong> and <strong>Bermuda</strong>. I learned to work hard while enjoying the view.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Australia.webp`} alt="Javier Flores traveling internationally" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 5: 2023 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">2023</span>
                                <h3>Working on the Ocean</h3>
                                <p>
                                    My life changed a lot when I started working on big Disney cruise ships. I lived on the ocean for months. We sailed to <strong>Colombia</strong>, <strong>Panama</strong>, and many islands like the <strong>Bahamas</strong>, <strong>Aruba</strong>, <strong>Curaçao</strong>, and <strong>Sint Maarten</strong>. Setting up big shows every night was super hard work, but seeing the magic come alive made it all worth it.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Frozen.webp`} alt="Javier Flores exploring the Caribbean" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 6: 2025 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">2025</span>
                                <h3>Australia and Up North</h3>
                                <p>
                                    I crossed the world again to work in <strong>Australia</strong> and <strong>New Zealand</strong>. When I had free time, I explored the amazing nature there. After that, I packed my bags and went way up north to travel and work across <strong>Canada</strong>.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Sydney.webp`} alt="Javier Flores in Sydney, Australia" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 7: May 2026 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">May 2026</span>
                                <h3>Listening to the Old World</h3>
                                <p>
                                    I went back to Europe to walk through <strong>Italy</strong>, <strong>Spain</strong>, and <strong>Portugal</strong>. This time, I didn't just look around; I listened. I studied how sound moves in very old buildings to get better at my job. It felt great to learn just for the joy of it.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Coctel-Calavera.webp`} alt="Javier Flores touring Southern Europe" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 8: Recent Months -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">Recent Months</span>
                                <h3>Going Far, Coming Home</h3>
                                <p>
                                    Lately, I've been moving fast, working in <strong>Puerto Rico</strong>, the <strong>UK</strong>, <strong>Denmark</strong>, and the <strong>United States</strong>. But no matter how far I go, my heart always brings me back to my hometown of <strong>Atlixco, Puebla</strong> in <strong>Mexico</strong>. Seeing the world is wonderful, but the best lesson I've learned is how good it feels to come home.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Alaska.webp`} alt="Javier Flores in recent global travels" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <div class="back-action">
                        <a href={`${base}`} class="primary-btn">Return to Home</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>

    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

        body, #wrapper {
            background-color: #0f131f !important;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
        }

        .journey-container {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-color: #0f131f;
        }

        .journey-hero {
            padding: 8rem 2rem 4rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 19, 31, 0.95) 0%, rgba(21, 27, 43, 0.8) 100%);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.15);
        }

        .hero-inner {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.1);
            color: #00e5ff;
            padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .hero-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background: rgba(21, 27, 43, 0.7);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
        }

        .stat-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.4);
        }

        .stat-number {
            display: block;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #00e5ff;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        /* Timeline Styles */
        .timeline-container {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 4rem auto;
            padding-left: 2rem;
        }

        .timeline-container::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 7px;
            top: 0;
            height: 100%;
            width: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #00e5ff 0%, #6fc3df 50%, #8d82c4 100%);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .timeline-item {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-marker {
            position: absolute;
            left: -2rem;
            top: 4px;
            width: 17px;
            height: 17px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #0f131f;
            border: 3px solid #00e5ff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.5);
        }

        .timeline-content {
            background: rgba(21, 27, 43, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 2rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
        }

        .timeline-content:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            border-color: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .timeline-date {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #00e5ff;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-content h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .timeline-content p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-images {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-images img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 220px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            transition: transform 0.25s ease;
        }

        .timeline-images img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        .back-action {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 5rem 0 3rem 0;
        }

        .journey-container header.major {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;
        }

        .journey-container header.major p {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .primary-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00e5ff, #0088cc);
            color: #0f131f !important;
            padding: 0.85rem 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
            transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
        }

        .primary-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.5);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .journey-hero {
                padding: 6rem 1rem 3rem 1rem;
            }
            .timeline-container {
                padding-left: 1.5rem;
            }
            .timeline-content {
                padding: 1.25rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</Layout>